# Backend Server permissions (Full access or specific subscriber topics)
user backend_service
topic read gateways/+/telemetry/#
topic write gateways/+/acks/#
topic read gateways/+/status
topic write gateways/+/commands/#
topic read gateways/+/responses/#

# Dynamic user pattern for Gateways
# Each gateway authenticates with its gateway_id and accesses only its own topic namespace
pattern write gateways/%u/telemetry/#
pattern read gateways/%u/acks/#
pattern write gateways/%u/status
pattern read gateways/%u/commands/#
pattern write gateways/%u/responses/#
